  "description": {
    "raw": "You plumb the depths of your mind for insight, leaving you momentarily frazzled. When you are about to make a d20 roll based on Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma, you can cast this spell to gain a +8 enhancement bonus to Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma for that roll, but you are dazed for 1 round afterward.",
    "search_text": "\"you plumb the depths of your mind for insight, leaving you momentarily frazzled. when you are about to make a d20 roll based on intelligence, wisdom, or charisma, you can cast this spell to gain a +8 enhancement bonus to intelligence, wisdom, or charisma for that roll, but you are dazed for 1 round afterward.\"",
